  {
   "id": "childstory-152529@post-2024-01-24",
   "gameId": "childstory-152529",
   "displayName": "Devlog. 913 day. 5 days after the release",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-01-24T03:11:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[Devlog. 913 day. 5 days after the release]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I delayed the update a bit in order to do a lot of work not only with the bugs that you promptly throw off to me, but also to improve other major aspects of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) The location of Masha's house has been changed. Added additional locations behind her house.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Fixed (one more) bug with music volume in cutscenes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Fixed bugs with triggers in Shironiva.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4) Added saves in some difficult moments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5) Reduced the number of enemies and their difficulty in some difficult locations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6) Many little bugs that I find while watching your videos and broadcasts have been improved (thanks a lot)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
