  {
   "id": "childstory-152529@post-2024-01-21",
   "gameId": "childstory-152529",
   "displayName": "[Devlog. Day 910. 2 days after the release]",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-01-21T00:59:52.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[Devlog. Day 910. 2 days after the release]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌚 I rolled out another hot fix that will probably break many saves! 🌚",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, I want to thank those who actively write to me about bugs in the game. I work tirelessly!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "—List of changes from 21.01.24",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1) Fixed a bug that caused purchased items to become visually available for purchase after re-entering the game. Now the \"Sold\" sign will always remain!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Added sounds to the hook-cat (you asked for it very much);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Fixed bugs related to cutscenes that break the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4) Fixed visual bugs and some errors in the text!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5) Fixed a bug that caused Sonya to break the game by breaking the pot she was holding in her hands;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6) Fixed a bug that caused the music volume to drop by 50 percent after saving;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6) Numerous other minor bugs have been fixed, which nevertheless had a great impact on the overall impression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "---",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This probably won't be the last hotfix I'll be pumping out in the near future, but I really appreciate your patience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For me, as a developer, this is the most important thing right now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Like ChildStory walkthroughs on YouTube, tell your friends about the game, play! It's very important now to talk about Sonya. Thanks! ✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
